    "body": "The promise returned by `write()` doesn't resolve until the chunk is actually decompressed, which doesn't happen until something reads from the readable side. Since using `await` prevents the function from reaching the `reader.read()` line, nothing ever reads, and the function cannot make progress. It's stuck waiting forever for something to read.\r\n\r\nThe behaviour of Chrome, Safari and Firefox is correct.",
